## Sixt-Ready Features Checklist

### Backend API
- [x] MockStorage singleton (persistent across requests)
- [x] GET /api/reservations (list with filters)
- [x] POST /api/reservations (create with conflict check)
- [x] PATCH /api/reservations/:id (update status, notes)
- [x] DELETE /api/reservations/:id (cancel)
- [x] GET /api/guests (list, search)
- [x] POST /api/guests (create)
- [x] PATCH /api/guests/:id (update)
- [x] GET /api/messages (list by reservation)
- [x] POST /api/messages (send)
- [x] PATCH /api/messages/:id (mark handled)

### Realism
- [x] Conflict detection (double booking protection)
- [x] Webhook simulation for Airbnb/Booking
- [x] Network delays (100-500ms)
- [x] Occasional errors (1 in 50 requests)
- [x] Rate limiting (10 req/min per IP)
- [x] Structured error codes
- [x] Request ID tracking (X-Request-ID header)
- [x] Cache headers on GET endpoints

### Frontend
- [x] Replace direct mock calls with API hooks
- [x] Loading states (Suspense/skeleton)
- [x] Error boundaries
- [x] Retry on network error
- [x] Optimistic updates for mutations
